  "description": "Erection of a single-storey outbuilding, to be used as a private gym/ garden room, ancillary to the main dwellinghouse.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall not be occupied at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the residential use of the dwelling known as 76 Lavender Grove and shall not be used as an independent dwelling or for commercial purposes, without the prior approval in writing of the local planning authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: In the interests of the amenities of the area and to comply with London Plan 2021 Policy D6&amp;nbsp; and Hackney Local Plan 2020 Policy LP17 which set out appropriate standards and requirements for all new dwellings.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
